```markdown
# ⚖️ Court-Data Fetcher & Mini-Dashboard

A secure and user-friendly Flask-based web application to fetch, manage, and view case metadata and judgments from Indian court websites like Delhi High Court and district eCourts. Includes a mini-dashboard for internal users to search, file, and download case records with role-based login and PostgreSQL integration.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 **User Login System** (Username/Password)
- 🧠 **Smart Case Search** via court name, type, number, and year
- 🏛️ **Dropdown Selection of Courts** dynamically fetched from PostgreSQL
- 🔎 **Advanced Case Viewer** with pagination, filtering, and sorting
- 📥 **PDF Download** of selected case records
- 🧾 **File New Case** form with:
  - Court name
  - Case type
  - Case number
  - Filing year
  - Submission date
  - Proposed hearing date
  - Parties' names
- 🤖 **CAPTCHA verification** on critical endpoints
- 🧮 **PostgreSQL-backed** for scalable and persistent storage
- 🎨 **Bootstrap 5 UI** for modern and responsive design

---

## 🧱 Tech Stack

| Layer            | Tech                                 |
|------------------|---------------------------------------|
| Framework        | Python Flask                         |
| Frontend         | HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap 5              |
| Database         | PostgreSQL                           |
| Auth             | Session-based Login                  |
| PDF Export       | xhtml2pdf / WeasyPrint               |
| Deployment Ready | Docker (optional)                    |

